    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d105">

                <pb facs="0204" n="130" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg130"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/5785</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Wheeler</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-07-10T19:00:00+09:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 10, 1917, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 12.43 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Viscount Motono unofficially asks me to
                    let you know that if it is convenient and agreeable for Root and his party to visit Japan on the way
                    back to the United States it would be a gratification to both the people and the
                    Government of Japan. Personally he expressed a very keen hope that this could be
                    arranged. Mr. Root’s party are expected to
                    arrive Vladivostok 17th instant.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wheeler</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
